  "question": {
    "text": "If both the roots of the equation <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> lie in the interval <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then",
